.TH SDE-SESSION 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
sde-session \- session manager of the Selviana Desktop Environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-session
[\-\-logout | \-\-version | \-\-help]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsde-session\fR starts the window manager (Openbox by default), \fBsde-desktop\fR, \fBsde-panel\fR, a polkit authentication agent and XDG autostart applications. It restarts essential components when they crash and stops everything when the session ends.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-logout
End the SDE session running on \fI$DISPLAY\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop/issues
